2026-07-27T08:40:34.3469885Z i /tmp/RtmpkXxyv9/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:40:34.3470421Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:40:34.3471051Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:40:34.3471895Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:40:34.3472798Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:40:34.3474390Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:40:34.3475394Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
